    "cline-pass": {
      "description": "ClinePass subscription models. Switch with --profile cline-pass or COCKPIT_CLINE_PROFILE=cline-pass. ClinePass lists no version-pinned Qwen3.8 Max 0902, so the frontend role is refused in strict mode until you opt in with allowUnpinned.",
